Backport for Podman 5.8.8:
  56e555bfc213d908dc5f7a7c55265eb49a075c20 api/compat: switch to moby/moby
  8c4edb6121872d9dadc855f5b327d62dccfd8ec8 libpod: include names-generator.go

Adapt the upstream v6 module references to v5. Retain the v5 storage info field
and reload entry point using storage 1.63's supported configuration APIs.

diff --git a/cmd/podman-testing/store_supported.go b/cmd/podman-testing/store_supported.go
index 0dd6ddd..79b7b7e 100644
--- a/cmd/podman-testing/store_supported.go
+++ b/cmd/podman-testing/store_supported.go
@@ -20,9 +20,8 @@ func init() {
